  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment FAQs\n\n### How to include student loan repayments as individual who has student loan outstanding?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at  3:22 PM\n\n\t\tYou can include the student loan repayment under the Main Form - Tax Reliefs - Student loan repayments & blind person's allowance.\n\nClick here to watch how to add student loan repayments on SA100 Tax return\n\nSA100 Main Form >> Blind Allowance & Student Loan\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
